  evidence = 'PARTIAL (C6-S1, PR 7414 and 7425): the draft-verify ladder is live on the code class and is now measured per rung (v_ladder_rung_outcomes). Code loop 7 days to 2026-11-04: gpt-oss-120b (first rung) merged 73 tasks in 1,014 calls at USD 0.042 a merge, glm-5.3 merged 63 in 351 calls (USD 0.148), kimi-k2.7-code merged 36 in 713 calls (USD 0.793) and took 70 percent of the ladder dollars. Daily kimi calls fell 101 (11-02) to 46 (11-03) to 36 (11-04) and ladder neurons 653k to 225k a day (down 65 percent) after the cheap first rung and SPEND-ENFORCE-1. The extension beyond the code class (cheapest sufficient model per route, escalate on a failed check) is the spend governor, agent_issues 1001813 (ROADMAP-1 QNFO.INFRA #2174, in flight in the code loop). | EARLIER: ' || COALESCE(evidence, '')
